  "method": [
    "Control uses in-process monotonic markers with no syscall wrapper.",
    "The interposed arm uses a dev-built libc wrapper for fsync, fdatasync and pwrite, emitted to a separate log. Every interval is paired with its own request on the same monotonic clock.",
    "The statement arm adds SQLite trace_v2 timers with unexpanded SQL. Background statements in a request window may run on different threads. The three writer commit intervals are correlated separately."
